I think i am finally going to complete nethack. At the moment I have
a level 30 wizard, 294hp ac -29 all stats maxed dx at 21.

  My first bit of luck was when I happened upon a polypile (big) from a
previous charachter on level 4 (he died stupidly I think) and had
left WOP's and holy water, + a luckstone. A little work and I had a level
6 wizard with ac -10. Then I found an alter, and started sacraficing
after a while I started getting spellbooks, but no named weapons WTF I thought-

and went exploring, I found them in a bag on a bones file???
So, now I had excalibur,frost+fire brand, and my +7 athame. Then, being
careless I dropped my holy water on my alter and it turned uncursed. :-(
This slowed down my game for a bit, so I went exploring(by this time I
had AC -21 and was invisible and double fast after I got god-given speed
and got speed boots from my pile).
  I cleared many graveyards, throne rooms ect and was soon level 30(As I had
excalibur to protect from level drain it was fairly easy.) I then found the
castle on level 29 and cleared it, getting the WOW(1). I then went up to my
polypile and Id'd the wand, and blessed it. Wished for +3 gray dragon scale
mail, got blessed +0 gdsm (this was so I could replace my cloak of
magic resistance with a cloak of displacement so I could be
invisible+ displaced.
  I had found some amulets in my travels, so identifyed them and threw the not-

very usefull ones on the polypile(all except esp as I had all resistances
and reflection). When I poly'd the amulets I founs that two had turned to
the same unknown type, Id'd that ,IT WAS LIFE SAVING(I was sure that was
impossible).

  Now I have +5 hawiian shirt,+4 gray dragon scale mail, +3 gauntlets of dex
+4 sheild of reflection, +3 helm of telepathy, +2 speed boots and +2 cloak
of displacement.(all blessed and rustproof(ed)

For weapons +7 fire brand +6 frost brand +8 stormy (no excalibur, was trying
to enchant stormy, weilded excalibur by mistake and smoked it), again all
rustproof and blessed.
As well as 6 amulets of life saving.
Also all usefull rings(is there any way to steal gold when poly'd into a
monster without your god getting pissed or the monster getting pissed?).

Now, some thoughts and questions.
A way to get holy water without using lawful alters or weilding a potion
when you have very high luck and praying is to polymorph other blessed
potions.
If you have a good charachter and find an altar with a preist(ess)
convert the altar to your god and go and look for all the gold you can.
Don't gain any more levels!!, now offer 400*gp to the priest(ess), it
dosen't matter if they are not of your god, as long as the alter is.You
will be rewarded for offering gold by AC gain.
After you get this gain _DON'T_ attack any peacfull monsters as your god
will then remove this intrinsic AC gain.(After I had got intrinsic AC down
to 5 I went and killed all the shopkeepers for their money, this was not
a good idea as I lost my AC gain and diddn't get much of it back.

IMHO one of the most usefull pieces of scenery in the game (apart from
altars)is the magic trap. If you have a good charachter with a blindfold
and magic resistance (and a quick get out like teleport at will, wand of
teleport, ect) he can just leap on and off the trap gaining intrinsics
from the monsters and charisma as well. All monsters can be generated
(except named ones) so wraiths, nurses and tengu's are sometimes found.

IMHO the most usefull intrinsic is magic resistance (especially in the lower
levels) as without it a poly trap can destroy your main armour and cloak,
as well as leaving you vulnerable to attack.

